<title>USA: Sioux City cattle off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City cattle off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was active. Compared with last Tuesday, slaughter steers and heifers traded $0.50 to $1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Steers - choice 2-3, part load reputation 1315 lbs 65.85. Choice 2-3, 1175-1350 lbs 63.50-64.85. Select and choice 2-3, 1075-1275 lbs 62.00-63.50.</p>
<p>Heifers - choice 2-3, 1050-1200 lbs 63.00-63.50. Select and choice 2-3, 1025-1250 lbs 61.50-63.00. Few select 2-3, 1000-1150 lbs 60.00-61.00.</p>
</text>
